      "protection": "National hate-crime statute covers gender identity; the division hate-crime statute explicitly covers gender identity. Enforcement outcomes for visitors are not documented.",
      "interaction": "Paper hate-crime recourse may help after an attack, but public support for birth-sex documents was 66% in a cited 2025 poll, indicating hostility risk without establishing current violence prevalence.",
      "status": "uncertain"
